  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220ºC/200ºC fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Cut carrot (see ingredients) and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender and brown around edges, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-1cf79700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-bbe78a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend and tomato paste until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the boiling water(see ingredients), coconut milk and red lentils. Season with salt and pepper, then stir to combine and bring to a simmer, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-ff1f2420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer the dhal mixture to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and lentils have softened, 20-25 minutes.\n• When dhal is done, remove from oven, stir through roasted veggies and a splash of water.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-42afcb30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Lightly scrunch each sheet of filo pastry (see ingredients) and place on top of dhal mixture to completely cover.\n• Gently brush (or spray) pastry with olive oil.\n• Return dhal pie to the oven and bake until pastry is golden, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-fcd8cf40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Indian lentil and cauliflower dhal filo pie between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f862ff0d0527cba53b49ba/step-0673fb50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
